<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Nov manufacturing output up 4.34 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Nov manufacturing output up 4.34 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production rose 4.34 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in November compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was up 0.86 percent.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Nov '96	 Oct '96	Nov '95</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  105.9	   105.0	  101.5</p>
<p>    Actual		   118.9	   115.7	  114.0</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
